#!/bin/sh
# Blocks secrets and junk from being committed. Rules: AGENTS.md → "Git and commits".
fail=0
err() { printf '\033[31m✗ %s\033[0m\n' "$1" >&2; fail=1; }

staged=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACMR)
[ -z "$staged" ] && exit 0

# 1. Files that must never be committed.
echo "$staged" | while IFS= read -r f; do
  case "$f" in
    .env.example) ;;
    .env|.env.*|*/.env|*/.env.*) echo "$f: env files hold secrets" ;;
    data/*) echo "$f: data/ holds the encryption key for saved connector keys" ;;
    *.pem|*.key|*.p12|*.dump|*.sql.gz|service-account*.json) echo "$f: key or database dump" ;;
    node_modules/*|.next/*|.next-mock/*|coverage/*) echo "$f: build output" ;;
    *.DS_Store|*.log) echo "$f: OS or log file" ;;
  esac
  case "$(basename "$f")" in
    *' '[0-9]|*' '[0-9].*) echo "$f: iCloud sync duplicate, delete it" ;;
  esac
done > /tmp/relife-precommit.$$
if [ -s /tmp/relife-precommit.$$ ]; then
  while IFS= read -r line; do err "$line"; done < /tmp/relife-precommit.$$
fi
rm -f /tmp/relife-precommit.$$

# 2. Large files (screenshots in docs/images are fine under 2 MB).
big=$(echo "$staged" | while IFS= read -r f; do
  [ -f "$f" ] || continue
  size=$(wc -c < "$f" | tr -d ' ')
  [ "$size" -gt 2097152 ] && echo "$f: $((size / 1024)) KB, over the 2 MB limit"
done)
[ -n "$big" ] && err "$big"

# 3. Secret-looking strings in added lines.
patterns='sk-ant-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}|sk-(proj-)?[A-Za-z0-9_-]{32,}|sk-or-[A-Za-z0-9_-]{20,}|gh[pousr]_[A-Za-z0-9]{30,}|github_pat_[A-Za-z0-9_]{30,}|AKIA[0-9A-Z]{16}|AIza[0-9A-Za-z_-]{35}|xox[abprs]-[A-Za-z0-9-]{10,}|[0-9]{8,10}:AA[0-9A-Za-z_-]{30,}|-----BEGIN [A-Z ]*PRIVATE KEY-----'
hits=$(git diff --cached -U0 --no-color -- . ':(exclude).githooks/*' | grep -E '^\+[^+]' | grep -En "$patterns")
if [ -n "$hits" ]; then
  err "possible secret in staged changes:"
  echo "$hits" | cut -c1-120 >&2
fi

# 4. Values from your dotsafe vault (only when dotsafe is installed and this repo is linked to it).
DOTSAFE=$(command -v dotsafe || { [ -x /Applications/dotsafe.app/Contents/MacOS/dotsafe ] && echo /Applications/dotsafe.app/Contents/MacOS/dotsafe; })
if [ -n "$DOTSAFE" ] && [ -f .dotsafe.json ]; then
  "$DOTSAFE" scan --staged >/tmp/relife-dotsafe.$$ 2>&1 || { err "dotsafe found vault values in staged files:"; cat /tmp/relife-dotsafe.$$ >&2; }
  rm -f /tmp/relife-dotsafe.$$
fi

if [ "$fail" -ne 0 ]; then
  echo "Commit blocked. Unstage with: git restore --staged <file>" >&2
  exit 1
fi
